      "body": "Up Next. Watch: The arms race in space and how the UK is defending itself. Video, 00:01:40SubsectionUKPublished5 hours agoWatch: How toxic smog from wildfires is making Indonesians sick. Video, 00:01:13SubsectionAsiaPublished10 hours agoWatch: Pilots eject as RAF jet crashes in Anglesey. Video, 00:00:47SubsectionWalesPublished11 hours agoWatch: Trump and Xi are meeting on US soil - what's at stake? Video, 00:01:29SubsectionWorldPublished15 hours agoRare look at the remote engine rooms fuelling China's AI boom. Video, 00:01:07SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoWatch: Key moments from Andy Burnham's first UN speech. Video, 00:00:58SubsectionWorldPublished1 day agoWatch: Threats, deals and passionate speeches at UNGA event. Video, 00:01:29SubsectionWorldPublished1 day agoWatch: Ukraine's race to counter new jet-powered Russian drones. Video, 00:02:01SubsectionEuropePublished1 day agoWatch: Timelapse shows typhoon barrelling towards Japan. Video, 00:00:48SubsectionAsiaPublished2 days agoInside Djibouti refugee camp for thousands fleeing Houthi advance in Yemen. Video, 00:00:45SubsectionWorldPublished2 days ago'No surprises' as results emerge in Russian parliamentary election. Video, 00:01:22SubsectionEuropePublished2 days ago",
