      "id": "theverge-2026-09-22-trump-says-us-is-officially-renaming-ai-super-intelligence",
      "title": "Trump says US is officially renaming AI ‘super intelligence’",
      "summary": "In a speech Tuesday morning at the UN General Assembly, Donald Trump railed against Iran, \"globalists,\" and transgender people while also claiming that the US is now \"officially\" renaming artificial intelligence to \"super intelligence.\" \nWhy? Because, according to Trump, the word artificial makes intelligence fake. Is that what makes it sound fake to you?\n\n\nRead the full story at The Verge.",
      "body": "Richard Lawler is a senior editor following news across tech, culture, policy, and entertainment. He joined The Verge in 2021 after several years covering news at Engadget.In a speech Tuesday morning at the UN General Assembly, Donald Trump railed against Iran, “globalists,” and transgender people while also claiming that the US is now “officially” renaming artificial intelligence to “super intelligence.”Why? Because, according to Trump, the word artificial makes intelligence fake. Is that what makes it sound fake to you?Follow topics and authors from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.Richard Lawler",
      "source": "The Verge",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
